7766203703703},{"hex":"#3455A2","share":0.16833043981481483},{"hex":"#E9895B","share":0.0904224537037037},{"hex":"#FBFCFB","share":0.07472511574074074},{"hex":"#572B27","share":0.07277199074074074},{"hex":"#CD3535","share":0.03197337962962963}],"thumbs":{}},"kit":{"summary":"Kinetic typography in these examples pairs oversized, often geometric or wide display letterforms with motion-driven treatments such as particle dissolves, warped or skewed letter bands, and cropped text sliding across imagery, set against dark or saturated flat backgrounds.","palette":[{"name":"Near black","hex":"#1C1E24"},{"name":"Deep ink","hex":"#0B0D12"},{"name":"Signal pink","hex":"#E0268A"},{"name":"Terracotta orange","hex":"#E8895A"},{"name":"Cobalt blue","hex":"#3556A8"},{"name":"Off white","hex":"#F4F1EA"}],"typography":{"display":"Oversized wide or geometric sans, heavy and bold in some cases, hairline light in others; letters often cropped by the frame, stretched, or warped into arcs and bands","body":"Small, neutral grotesque sans with tight tracking, used sparingly for captions and navigation","notes":"Scale contrast is the core device: huge display words against tiny supporting text. Letterforms are treated as graphic shapes that can be distorted, dotted into particles, or repeated in rows."},"radius":8,"blur":0,"motion":{"curve":"cubic-bezier(0.7, 0, 0.2, 1) with GSAP-style ease-out for pointer-following","duration_ms":700,"notes":"Inferred from the style's conventions rather than observed timing: letters typically ease in and out over roughly 600 to 800 ms, with staggered per-character or per-line offsets and pointer-reactive repulsion or attraction."},"related":["particle dot-matrix text","warped wavy type bands","oversized cropped hero headline","scroll-driven text reveal marquee"]},"cost":{"type":"cost","usd":0.019464225,"inputTokens":37697,"outputTokens":3012,"searches":null,"ms":27281,"models":["anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5"]}}